## 12. Pattern 1 - Left Half Pyramid

```python
for i in range(5):
    for j in range(i + 1):
        print("*", end="")
    print()
```

**Output:**
```text
*
**
***
****
*****
```

## 13. Pattern 2 - Right Half Pyramid

```python
for i in range(5):
    for j in range(5 - i - 1):
        print(" ", end="")
    for j in range(i + 1):
        print("*", end="")
    print()
```

**Output:**
```text
    *
   **
  ***
 ****
*****
```

## 14. Pattern 3 - Full Pyramid

```python
n = 5

for i in range(n):
    for j in range(n - i - 1):
        print(" ", end="")
    for j in range(2 * i + 1):
        print("*", end="")
    print()
```

**Output:**
```text
    *
   ***
  *****
 *******
*********
```

